@host = http://localhost:8000

### Trivial sleeper used by the demos
GET {{host}}/sleep/200

### 5 calls sequentially (~1000ms+)
GET {{host}}/seq

### 5 calls concurrently (~200ms)
GET {{host}}/concurrent

### Sync handler -> threadpool
GET {{host}}/threadpool-sync

### DANGEROUS — freezes loop for 1 second
GET {{host}}/blocking-sleep

### Offloaded blocking work — loop stays responsive
GET {{host}}/offload/500
